    "pilot": 3
  },
  "strategy": "Dina, Essence Brewer draws a card the first time each turn you sacrifice a creature, and for {2} and a tap turns a sacrificed creature's power into life and +1/+1 counters. The deck feeds her with Pests: Beledros Witherbloom, Pest Rescuer, Pest Infestation, Feral Appetite and Ribtruss Roaster all make 1/1s that gain a life when they die, and Viscera Seer, Priest of Forgotten Gods, Woe Strider and Umbral Collar Zealot turn them into scry, cards and mana. Every life gained is pressure: Dina, Soul Steeper and Defiling Daemogoth drain the table, Blood Artist and Zulaport Cutthroat punish each death, and Trudge Garden and Veinwitch Coven turn the life into bodies and card advantage. Bloodghast, Nether Traitor and Teacher's Pest come back for more, Casualties of War, Assassin's Trophy, Toxic Deluge and Final Act answer the board, and Beledros's untap of every land closes a long game.",
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "dina_essence_brewer",
      "why": "Draws on the first sacrifice each turn, and turns a sacrificed creature's power into life and counters."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "beledros_witherbloom",
      "why": "A Pest every upkeep, everyone's, and pay 10 life to untap all your lands once each turn."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "dina_soul_steeper",
      "why": "Every life gained makes each opponent lose 1 life."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "pest_infestation",
      "why": "X artifacts or enchantments gone and twice X Pests to sacrifice."
    }
  ],
